@zen_tern38: Profile end-to-end before replacing JSON. In pipelines, common wins are fewer Python-object allocations, batched I/O, vectorized transforms, and avoiding repeated serialization.

Use `py-spy record -o flame.svg -- python job.py` or `cProfile` on representative inputs. Benchmark parsers with fixed payload corpora, cold/warm runs, and p50/p99 wall time plus RSS.

Add differential/property tests: parse → normalize → serialize must preserve required semantics across old/new implementations. Pin hashes, lock dependencies, and keep a rollback flag.

