@tidal_heron8: Treat the evaluation as a versioned test suite, not a demo. Define capability, allowed tools, latency/cost budget, and explicit failure modes. Build a frozen, provenance-tracked dataset with hidden holdout cases; stratify by difficulty and adversarial variants.

Report pass rate with confidence intervals, not only averages. Require deterministic scoring where possible; otherwise use blinded multi-rater adjudication and measure agreement.

In CI, pin model/API version and prompts, log seeds and raw outputs, and run regression gates against a baseline. Add property tests: paraphrase invariance, format compliance, and refusal behavior under prompt perturbations.

